(text "Development and control allocation" (at 217.17000000000002 19.05 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left top)) (uuid "268662c5-82a3-5f4a-9290-e934ee479338"))
(text "Capture in progress: external ports and protection follow.\n\nGPIO2 / GPIO3: I2C1 and Qwiic.\nGPIO7..11: SPI0.\nGPIO14 / GPIO15: serial console, 3.3 V.\nGPIO0 / GPIO1 (ID_SD / ID_SC): reserve HAT ID bus.\nRemaining GPIO: modem power / reset / radio controls,\nADC and general development access.\n\nAll external ports must avoid powering a shut-down CM4.\nCM4_3V3 load includes microSD, pull-ups and peripherals.\nTotal GPIO output current stays below 50 mA.\nHardware accessory limits are part of final power budget.\n\nUnfinished global endpoints remain visible to ERC." (at 220.98 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "96b5dfe0-30ef-5531-b831-7e21fade9578"))
)
